      ],
      "source": "https://cityofemerado.com/about-us"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town was named after Emery, a bonanza farm owner who owned 4,480 acres of prime land.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://cityofemerado.com/about-us"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town’s core values emphasize guided growth and the preservation of its historical, cultural, and natural heritage.",
